    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealicious is a cooking-themed kitchen management deck-builder card game. Discover and stack cards together to cook meals, manage your kitchen space and expand eventually hiring staff as you grow your empire. Discover unique cards which offer special abilities/bonuses! Can you collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534090/extras/3c3e0f9f84f441fb72d3c6e2fa6f7acf.avif?t=1742234486\" width=300 height=136 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ cards to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many packs to discover and unpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen customization &amp; expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management of staff (hire &amp; fire)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold system (pay bills on time!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534090/extras/8c3b533b1d7bf26d97b02902d3196059.avif?t=1742234486\" width=300 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack and move cards freely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534090/extras/c35fb1f745560bdcc96070c877731afd.poster.avif?t=1742234486\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama